  <!-- The torso spheres are a column on the torso's midplane, placed by hand against
       g1_description's torso mesh. From the waist to the chest (torso z 0.04-0.16 m) their
       sides stay 6-19 mm inside the torso's flanks, where the hanging upper arms are 9 mm
       from the real torso at home, so the shoulder-yaw spheres clear them by 25 mm there
       (CL_Assets/README.md). -->
